# Airframe workspace attributes. Travels with the .airframe/ template.
#
# Defence in depth for the UI caches: even if one is force-added to the index,
# `-diff` stops git from emitting its contents into diffs, patches, and log -p.
# These files are single-line JSON, so an ordinary textual diff of one costs
# the full size of both the old and the new copy.
agilecockpit-launch-cache.json  -diff -merge linguist-generated
agilecockpit-traceability-cache.json -diff -merge linguist-generated
